  "notes": "つぐ has different meanings depending on the kanji used.\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {次|つ}ぐ: to come next, to follow in rank\n- ⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧: to inherit, to succeed (position/business)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS WITH {次|つ}ぐ:\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}ぐ: second to X, after X\n- ⟦{相|あい}{次|つ}ぐ→相次ぐ：14869_aitsugu⟧: to happen one after another\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS WITH {継|つ}ぐ:\n- ⟦{家業|かぎょう}→家業：12353_kagyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧: to take over family business\n- ⟦{伝統|でんとう}→伝統：09585_dentou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧: to carry on tradition\n- ⟦{後|あと}→後：09580_ato⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧: to succeed someone\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive with {次|つ}ぐ; transitive with ⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧.",
